{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012cGU6vueaQsUiz2biMMRfQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"number\": 577,\n3\t  \"title\": \"[REQUEST] My own custom progress bar module and more!\",\n4\t  \"body\": \"**How would you improve Rich?**\\n\\nA few months ago, I made my own custom progress bars that can be customised to look like emojis or text, I also made a function to make printing bars like --------- or ********** easier, and a function to surround a string with a character/emoji on either side. I know these features might have been already implemented but please check my repo.\\n\\n**What problem does it solve for you?**\\n\\nMy progress bars are more customizable but may need some changes. Please check my repo for more info\\nClick here to go to [my repo](https://github.com/Mathdallas-code/Emoji-bars)\",\n5\t  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n6\t  \"created_at\": \"2026-03-20T09:52:36Z\",\n7\t  \"labels\": [\n8\t    \"Needs triage\"\n9\t  ]\n10\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ca314025-a7d9-4156-8ed6-2bfdaa45cbb5","uuid":"b99ebb94-6310-4e2e-82ee-6f27454b05ff","timestamp":"2026-10-26T09:57:05.927Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/gh-aw/agent/issue.json","content":"{\n  \"number\": 577,\n  \"title\": \"[REQUEST] My own custom progress bar module and more!\",\n  \"body\": \"**How would you improve Rich?**\\n\\nA few months ago, I made my own custom progress bars that can be customised to look like emojis or text, I also made a function to make printing bars like --------- or ********** easier, and a function to surround a string with a character/emoji on either side. I know these features might have been already implemented but please check my repo.\\n\\n**What problem does it solve for you?**\\n\\nMy progress bars are more customizable but may need some changes. Please check my repo for more info\\nClick here to go to [my repo](https://github.com/Mathdallas-code/Emoji-bars)\",\n  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-03-20T09:52:36Z\",\n  \"labels\": [\n    \"Needs triage\"\n  ]\n}","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":10}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012cGU6vueaQsUiz2biMMRfQ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
